{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a7cd8598-50b6-5913-9012-b2459288ec8b", "source_ordinal": 4072, "reading_ordinal": 4275, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "慢点发财", "published_at": "2026-09-12T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2081779894636240979/answer/2081998328523445929"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "其实千言万语汇成一个要害——身为社会成员，不要撕裂社会、破坏社会信任。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "打假曝光是好事，让不良商家、不法经营不敢嚣张，这是正义之举。你因此博取名望，然后带点完全不沾边的货，获取社会的回馈，无可厚非。这样正循环就建立起来了。", "char_start": 36, "char_end": 111}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "但是一旦你做成抓住人小辫子就自己敲诈勒索，用敲诈勒来回本、盈利，就把社会原本因为信任你的义举而授予你的社会资本盗用做了私刑的刑具。", "char_start": 112, "char_end": 177}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这跟辛辛苦苦当上书记然后开始贪污本质一样恶劣——削尖脑袋获取人民信任，原来是要拿人民信任做你抢劫的刀。", "char_start": 178, "char_end": 229}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "盗取公器以谋私利，让老百姓如何再对其它勇于为社会贡献的人授予信任？会不会张三李四现在为民请命，我们拍手叫好，回头张三李四也会利用我们的肯定和拥护开始欺男霸女、巧取豪夺？", "char_start": 230, "char_end": 314}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "这是从根上撕毁社会契约，和官员贪污曝光必须给予严惩一样，不从重处置会深刻损害社会成员对基本社会规则的信任。", "char_start": 315, "char_end": 368}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "没发现则已，发现了、经过了正式的处理，却让人觉得“赚这么多还挺值的”，等于证明了“这么干即使被抓住总的来说都是赚的”，接下来所有为民请命的人就都成了洗不净的嫌疑犯。", "char_start": 369, "char_end": 451}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "老百姓很难放心的支持任何正面努力，甚至越正义、越光明，越会被怀疑、被猜忌。", "char_start": 452, "char_end": 489}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "越做好人，越会因为你太像好人所以你一定是坏人，这是个什么世道？", "char_start": 490, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "和这个危害相比，因为贫穷而持刀抢劫、凭拳头敲诈，反而危害小多了。", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 554}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "做好人，就好好做。", "char_start": 555, "char_end": 564}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "慢点发财。", "char_start": 565, "char_end": 570}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "人民信任你，喜欢你，小心的对待，你急什么呢？", "char_start": 571, "char_end": 593}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "慢点发财。", "char_start": 594, "char_end": 599}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0607"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：打假网红铁头敲诈勒索案一审被判八年，伙同他人威胁曝黑料，向带货主播索要数百克黄金，哪些信息值得关注？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014"], "summary": "围绕“慢点发财”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“其实千言万语汇成一个要害——身为社会成员，不要撕裂社会、破坏社会信任。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "其实千言万语汇成一个要害——身为社会成员，不要撕裂社会、破坏社会信任。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 35, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "ee68d5da-fae1-52f6-ac17-82d0e0fc6a51", "source_ordinal": 4071, "reading_ordinal": 4276, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "滑滑客厅", "published_at": "2026-09-12T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2079581505047762015/answer/2081810683285475769"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "有一个法则建议各位设计客厅时充分考虑——客厅家具都要可移动。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "可以是普通的万向脚轮，可以是那种多滚珠的隐形滑动器，可以是能承重的福马轮。实在不行，可以用支脚悬空，方便使用搬家用的起重式滑动器。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "总之，客厅里非靠墙的一切陈设，都应该有极为轻松的移动属性。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "茶几也罢，座椅也罢，展示柜也罢、酒柜也罢、落地投影幕也罢，投影机柜也罢……客厅里的家具全体机动化。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "然后你就不太需要纠结这个问题了。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 193}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "想和家人看个电影，把荧幕一拉，投影机一推，茶几一摆，小沙发一挪，舒舒服服。", "char_start": 194, "char_end": 231}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "想在客厅里玩玩VR，呼啦啦全部推到靠墙，空旷空间随你施展。", "char_start": 232, "char_end": 261}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "就地铺块毛皮地毯，和家人躺在地上打滚看剧都行——要干点别的也不是不行。", "char_start": 262, "char_end": 297}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "想在家里练钢管舞，都可以在天花地面之间快装一根就原地起飞。", "char_start": 298, "char_end": 327}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "吵架了不想看那个鸟人，可以在客厅里扎个帐篷。", "char_start": 328, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你就一个选择要做——要不要那种没处放的大沙发。", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "建议是不要，直接用高端的人体工学椅、折叠月亮椅代替。折叠月亮椅还可以出去野营时用上。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 417}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "其实人体工学椅展开躺平不比沙发差，但在客厅脚一蹬就在几个台面之间飞来飞去的感觉沙发可给不了。", "char_start": 418, "char_end": 464}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "只要解决掉占半间房的大沙发组，客厅就能轻松变成多功能室内广场，这对你是真正的利益最大化。——在客厅里摆一个庞大的沙发组，把格局限定死，功能坍缩成单调用途，这个做法本身很不经济。", "char_start": 465, "char_end": 553}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "不用这个做法，其实传统客厅的功能还是可以保留。反正是顺带兼容，你也不必愁它有没有意义了。", "char_start": 554, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "它至少可以在你父母来访时扮一下成熟稳重，免得ta们嘀咕觉得你太疯狂——毕竟装钢管还是有点不太好解释的。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 650}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "补充一点——注意地面的恰当位置留个隐形地插，否则地面中央不好用电，注意别选那种凸出地面的地插，丑且绊脚。但在另一方面，要注意最近的水源要有可靠的防溢水设计，地面低处最好有地漏，地插所在的线路也要有可靠的过载保护。因为万一漏水，地插是第一个短路的。", "char_start": 651, "char_end": 774}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "别回头一起床踩在带电的水里，这死法太上头了。", "char_start": 775, "char_end": 797}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0607"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：一设计师称中国客厅已失去意义，反映了当下怎样的家庭生活变化？你家还有客厅吗，是怎样的？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“滑滑客厅”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“有一个法则建议各位设计客厅时充分考虑——客厅家具都要可移动。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "有一个法则建议各位设计客厅时充分考虑——客厅家具都要可移动。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "fa9ad31e-ce15-5830-8c99-cdbeccfd276f", "source_ordinal": 4070, "reading_ordinal": 4277, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "礼兵", "published_at": "2026-09-13T02:52:33.475000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2078438547917379233/answer/2082139923457503496"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "和人协商可能导致对方利益受损的分歧，有一些礼节上的准备要做。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）先寻求无损的解决方案。", "char_start": 31, "char_end": 44}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "在你这个情况下，可以询问一下其他寝室有没有人和你有一样的烦恼，有没有其它同学也想早起但和晚睡党适配不了的。", "char_start": 45, "char_end": 98}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "如果找得到，那不妨大家商量一下，如果合意，那就找辅导员、生活老师协调安排一下。", "char_start": 99, "char_end": 138}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "2）寻先做可见的“自己适应”的努力。", "char_start": 139, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "例如戴夸张的大耳罩睡觉，换上厚窗帘。你可以适当夸张一点，显眼一点，让对方看到你是努力了的。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 203}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个努力主要是证明一种姿态——我不理所当然的认为我的习惯就是正义的、优先的，你的习惯就是落后的、次要的。", "char_start": 204, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "相反，无论你的习惯如何——如何不符合我的父母对我的教导、如何不符合一般社会大众的主流意见——只要不违法、不违反明文的规定，我都视为我有一定的屈己从人、中途相遇的友好义务。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "我不觉得委屈，我把这视为任何朋友要在一起必须要承担的默认付出，是我为“我希望和你友好”这个我自己的愿望应做的努力。就像我希望吃白菜，我要花力气种白菜一样。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 420}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "哪有“想交朋友，而自己任何适应都不需要做，朋友哪里和自己冲突就在哪里惩罚朋友”的这种道理呢？", "char_start": 421, "char_end": 467}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "想交朋友，想好好往来，就要有相应的【自愿的】努力。", "char_start": 468, "char_end": 493}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "我先把这个努力做了，而且不怒气冲冲的做，不满腔怨气的做，而是心平气和的做，理所当然的做。", "char_start": 494, "char_end": 538}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "但我也是“狡猾”的——我不会做得无声无息、无法察觉。", "char_start": 539, "char_end": 565}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这点心理压力你还是该担的，何况这本来就是我要发送的信号，要做的铺垫。让你看到是我的用意之一，只要不太大张旗鼓就可以了。", "char_start": 566, "char_end": 625}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "3）在仍然无果的前提下，开始引入管理员、辅导员这些秩序调解者，以“我不是说张三无权这么做，只是我适应过了确实适应不了，我能看到、能调用的资源和我的权利不如你们，请你们帮助进行有效协调”的姿态寻求解决。", "char_start": 626, "char_end": 726}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "“我从来没有一句话说这位同学没权利这样生活”，这一点很重要。", "char_start": 727, "char_end": 757}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "可能我内心里真有这个想法，但我有想法不等于人家真的就没权利了。我又不是法官、不是皇帝，怎么可能我觉得谁不对就是谁不对，谁该死谁就得去死？", "char_start": 758, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个钢铁般的自觉，就是真正的平等和真正的尊重。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 850}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "都到了这个时候，你在做完了这些努力、这些铺垫之后，仍然抱着这个平和、友善的态度去协调，首先你会将对方的抵触情绪最小化。", "char_start": 851, "char_end": 910}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "未必可以消除到完全没有，但是至少不会直接不共戴天。无论这问题解不解决，你们还要在一个班级、一个学院里共存好几年，解决任何问题时不要伤害到这个大局，都是首要的考虑。", "char_start": 911, "char_end": 992}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "其次，你的心态摆得够平，矛盾没有激化，对方有一定的配合、成全之意，这事总有回旋的余地。", "char_start": 993, "char_end": 1036}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "其实对方有了配合的动作，有所收敛，有所努力，你的感受就会大为好转，再在别的方面多积累点交情，这个问题可以持续向好，不也解决了？", "char_start": 1037, "char_end": 1100}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "如果实在不行，你可以提出“要不我出去住，你给我备注好不算我违规也行”——说到这里，协调人一般都会倾向向对方施压，推动对方让步。", "char_start": 1101, "char_end": 1164}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这时候主要矛盾就转移到协调人和对方之间了。", "char_start": 1165, "char_end": 1186}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "事实上，承诺给你安宁环境的本来就是管理者们，这和矛盾本来就应该发生在管理者和对方之间。你自己冲在前面、用私人的针对、惩罚、威胁来尝试解决问题，反而把管理问题办成了私人矛盾。", "char_start": 1187, "char_end": 1273}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "管理者对ta施压，ta去跟管理者打对攻，管理者有一整个防御系统和ta对抗，远比你去处理要有效。解决问题要比你容易得多。", "char_start": 1274, "char_end": 1333}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "很多人哪里做得不好？", "char_start": 1335, "char_end": 1345}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "不好在了把“礼”视为一种借贷、一种恩德了。认为“先礼后兵”的“礼”是在别人已经亏欠自己时的一种借款。", "char_start": 1346, "char_end": 1396}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "我查一查规章制度，一旦根据我对规章制度的理解认定你有错，我就觉得已经握住了你的把柄，你妨碍了我的利益而在我眼里理亏，你就已经该死。对已经该死的你，我没有告官、没有痛击，而是好声好气的和你商量，这在我已经是高抬贵手，是有恩于你了。", "char_start": 1397, "char_end": 1511}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "有一种“其实我可以用兵，但我不用兵而用礼，你应该感恩，不感恩我加倍用兵干你”的想法。", "char_start": 1512, "char_end": 1554}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "但在这里其实存在一个致命的错误——承诺给你你应该得到那些权利的，是管理机构、是管理者，你是否有被承诺的利益受损，必须要先经过管理机构的正规程序判定、确认，你才能拿对方的违规来说事。", "char_start": 1555, "char_end": 1645}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "在经过这个程序之前，无论你自己觉得多有充分依据、多么悲愤，这个认定都仍然是你的个人看法，是你的观点而不是社会意义上的客观事实，是不构成对方的行动义务的。", "char_start": 1646, "char_end": 1722}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "一旦你有任何这类想法、行为，你都首先会被认定（而且是广泛的被认定）为一个“自居官方审判员的人”。", "char_start": 1723, "char_end": 1771}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你以这样的逻辑行事，不得逞则已，一旦得逞了，所有人都会感觉到自己不但要受到官方的监督审判，还要得到你的个人认可，否则搞不好下场和你这个室友一样，这种恐惧感会驱动群体对你产生本能的排斥。", "char_start": 1772, "char_end": 1864}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "哪怕这个室友确有失德失范之处，人们仍然会如坐针毡。", "char_start": 1865, "char_end": 1890}, {"paragraph_id": "P036", "field": "body", "index": 36, "text": "因为人不能接受在已经承受公家审视的基础上，再接受一切私人的审视。这太令人窒息和沉重了——这么做的人，很难被称为朋友。", "char_start": 1891, "char_end": 1949}, {"paragraph_id": "P037", "field": "body", "index": 37, "text": "在你看这是伸张正义，在众人是“些天子以令诸侯”。人们的关注不会是你失眠多么困扰，而是“你一闹就能搞到人”。你成了一个危险因素，一个进入哪个场合就令人紧张的事物。", "char_start": 1950, "char_end": 2030}, {"paragraph_id": "P038", "field": "body", "index": 38, "text": "人要最大化的自我保护，怎么能不排斥你呢？", "char_start": 2031, "char_end": 2051}, {"paragraph_id": "P039", "field": "body", "index": 39, "text": "先礼后兵，正确的心态应该是这个礼不是借款、不是恩情，而是我身为朋友、邻人应尽的努力。", "char_start": 2053, "char_end": 2095}, {"paragraph_id": "P040", "field": "body", "index": 40, "text": "你能因此受触动，向我走来，与我中途相遇，我不以之为理所当然。", "char_start": 2096, "char_end": 2126}, {"paragraph_id": "P041", "field": "body", "index": 41, "text": "我不会觉得因为我对你有礼，你作出的改变就是该当的，只是还我无比“高尚”、慷慨借给你的债。", "char_start": 2127, "char_end": 2171}, {"paragraph_id": "P042", "field": "body", "index": 42, "text": "在我看来，这是你付出了特殊的努力，是对我有特别的友好。我也许没法给予什么实质的报酬，但起码在感情上会感谢你。", "char_start": 2172, "char_end": 2226}, {"paragraph_id": "P043", "field": "body", "index": 43, "text": "因为我不认可“你妨碍我的利益就一定是你不对、你对不起我”这种唯我独尊的价值观。", "char_start": 2227, "char_end": 2266}, {"paragraph_id": "P044", "field": "body", "index": 44, "text": "当我用尽礼仪，仍然不能承受你造成的我的困扰，我可能不能不引入一些对你有强制作用的外力，让你即使主观上不愿意，但客观上不能不有所改变——这就是所谓的“用兵”。", "char_start": 2267, "char_end": 2345}, {"paragraph_id": "P045", "field": "body", "index": 45, "text": "但我不把这当作对你的惩罚、对你的“复仇”，而视为令人遗憾的、有所歉疚的不得已。而且我的首要诉求，只是要求得问题的良好解决。", "char_start": 2346, "char_end": 2407}, {"paragraph_id": "P046", "field": "body", "index": 46, "text": "只要我有一点余地，哪怕天子就在我手里，我把天子当马骑，我都不愿“挟天子以令诸侯”。", "char_start": 2408, "char_end": 2449}, {"paragraph_id": "P047", "field": "body", "index": 47, "text": "而且这是我普遍的做人风格，对所有人都一样。", "char_start": 2450, "char_end": 2471}, {"paragraph_id": "P048", "field": "body", "index": 48, "text": "如果我和人有矛盾，一定会看到我先做努力，也会给足够的协调机会，大家都能很好的解决问题，甚至一笑泯恩仇、不打不相识。", "char_start": 2472, "char_end": 2529}, {"paragraph_id": "P049", "field": "body", "index": 49, "text": "而管理者也知道我是个得饶人处且饶人的人，ta们调解我和别人的矛盾，比调解一般人之间的矛盾主动很多、从容很多。跟我都化解不了矛盾的人，", "char_start": 2530, "char_end": 2596}, {"paragraph_id": "P050", "field": "body", "index": 50, "text": "我这样一个人，和你都处不来，有矛盾你都化解不了，你得是个什么妖怪？", "char_start": 2597, "char_end": 2630}, {"paragraph_id": "P051", "field": "body", "index": 51, "text": "这种压力会自然而然的存在，在你给了足够多和解空间和调整余地的前提下，对方多少都会给出某种配合。", "char_start": 2631, "char_end": 2678}, {"paragraph_id": "P052", "field": "body", "index": 52, "text": "一有配合，你及时给予感谢，给予正面激励，矛盾松动、软化，天大的事情有了善意都没那么难办。", "char_start": 2679, "char_end": 2723}, {"paragraph_id": "P053", "field": "body", "index": 53, "text": "关键是，一旦你确认对方是友好的、善意的，你就会多不少体谅和耐心，对方的配合不足对你就不太容易被你理解为一种刻意的示威和报复，你不会每分每秒沉浸在“我无力反击，不得不忍受这种凌辱之中”的屈辱感之中。", "char_start": 2724, "char_end": 2822}, {"paragraph_id": "P054", "field": "body", "index": 54, "text": "其实这个按秒增长的由愤恨、无力而生的屈辱感，才是人与人矛盾迅速激化的第一原因。", "char_start": 2823, "char_end": 2862}, {"paragraph_id": "P055", "field": "body", "index": 55, "text": "踩了一脚，别了一头，只消片刻，就急毒攻心，足以愤而杀人。", "char_start": 2863, "char_end": 2891}, {"paragraph_id": "P056", "field": "body", "index": 56, "text": "仁爱的第一收益，是它能从根上阻断你自己的痛苦和屈辱感，让你可以基于理性和乐观去行动，首先从这种病毒般的自我折磨里解脱。", "char_start": 2892, "char_end": 2951}, {"paragraph_id": "P057", "field": "body", "index": 57, "text": "不堵住这毒液的源泉，只要稍有触动，事态没有向你想要的方向发展的每分每秒都会飞快的转化为怨恨和愤怒。", "char_start": 2952, "char_end": 3001}, {"paragraph_id": "P058", "field": "body", "index": 58, "text": "而这个泉眼仅仅是那句“明明是ta的错”。", "char_start": 3002, "char_end": 3022}, {"paragraph_id": "P059", "field": "body", "index": 59, "text": "你要记住，你也不能接受另一个人独自判定“这明明是你的错”，你也不能接受对方先独自判你有罪，然后要求你为ta没有直接惩罚你就感恩戴德。", "char_start": 3023, "char_end": 3089}, {"paragraph_id": "P060", "field": "body", "index": 60, "text": "你不能，谁都不能。", "char_start": 3090, "char_end": 3099}, {"paragraph_id": "P061", "field": "body", "index": 61, "text": "所以你不能轮到自己“有理”的时候就这么做。你必须要丢开这种化妆成“正义观”的唯我独尊的逻辑。", "char_start": 3100, "char_end": 3146}, {"paragraph_id": "P062", "field": "body", "index": 62, "text": "只要你稍一疏忽，毒泉就要启动，几天时间就能活活淹没你的理智。", "char_start": 3147, "char_end": 3177}, {"paragraph_id": "P063", "field": "body", "index": 63, "text": "先礼后兵，礼在兵前。", "char_start": 3178, "char_end": 3188}, {"paragraph_id": "P064", "field": "body", "index": 64, "text": "礼不收费。", "char_start": 3189, "char_end": 3194}, {"paragraph_id": "P065", "field": "body", "index": 65, "text": "这不屈辱，这救的是你自己。", "char_start": 3195, "char_end": 3208}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 67}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0607"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：宿舍作息不一致时，怎样沟通才能既解决问题又不伤和气？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035", "P036", "P037", "P038", "P039", "P040", "P041", "P042", "P043", "P044", "P045", "P046", "P047", "P048", "P049", "P050", "P051", "P052", "P053", "P054", "P055", "P056", "P057", "P058", "P059", "P060", "P061", "P062", "P063", "P064", "P065"], "summary": "围绕“礼兵”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“和人协商可能导致对方利益受损的分歧，有一些礼节上的准备要做。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "和人协商可能导致对方利益受损的分歧，有一些礼节上的准备要做。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 30, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8fd2c50d-a59f-50e9-945c-0798d74c6350", "source_ordinal": 4069, "reading_ordinal": 4278, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "难得优雅", "published_at": "2026-09-13T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://afdian.com/p/a332e468a8eb11f1b5655254001e7c00"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "遗憾的是，这是个悖论——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "会这样轻易冒犯人而不自知的人，对“对方认为这是一种冒犯”的反应往往很糟糕，常常反而发怒和报复。而那些收到这个判定会感到抱歉并完全尊重的人，其实很少会真的冒犯到你。", "char_start": 13, "char_end": 94}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "说白了——该说的人往往说不得，说得的人往往不用说。", "char_start": 95, "char_end": 120}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "那些说不得的人一说就炸，不管你多优雅都一样。", "char_start": 121, "char_end": 143}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你能做的基本只有消极防御，例如“这是女生的秘密”“哪里哪里，我大众脸、跟谁都像”。", "char_start": 144, "char_end": 185}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "做“冒犯提醒”想要不出问题，要么是真的亲人好友，有信任基础，足以让对方相信这是善意的提醒；要么是你位高权重，有强大的报复能力，足以让对方意识到这是在真正的重罚之前的善意警告，否则跟没什么交道、也没有展现什么实力、对对方也不知深浅的陌生人，发出“你在冒犯”的信号都是在冒险。", "char_start": 186, "char_end": 322}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "实话实说，不如上面这些技巧性的场面话做推挡来得稳妥有效。", "char_start": 323, "char_end": 351}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "在16-26岁这个段落里，女性社会化程度往往更深，常常会觉得同龄男性说话不够有分寸，对别人的情绪不够敏感，而且很容易被触怒。", "char_start": 352, "char_end": 414}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这是客观现实，实在难以苛责勉强。强求人超越自己的发育阶段，这样对人太苛刻了。", "char_start": 415, "char_end": 453}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "但反过来，要求你在这个阶段就有这宽容豁达的心态，也对你太苛刻了。", "char_start": 454, "char_end": 486}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "年轻的女孩子，也同样敏感而缺少耐心。", "char_start": 487, "char_end": 505}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要不然为什么屡屡发生青年情侣被大叔拆散的事故呢？", "char_start": 506, "char_end": 530}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "其实无非是二十七八岁以后的男性已经在足够多的教训中习得了对对方情绪的观察力，也有了足够多的温和的处理手段，而且对对方的负面情绪有更稳定的接受能力，所以给了年轻女性好的多的触感罢了。", "char_start": 531, "char_end": 621}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "对同龄男友稍微有点情绪，要么发的火比你还大，要么会动作过猛的弥补，最初是很惊喜甜蜜，但在中长期会力不能支，总在在之后的某个时候因为筋疲力尽而情绪反扑，还是结果不好。", "char_start": 622, "char_end": 704}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "成熟男性本来就大大的不容易触发负面情绪，而触发之后，成熟男性的道歉、安抚往往更加精准，常常那稍微道个歉，只用很小的动作就抹平了隐患。", "char_start": 705, "char_end": 771}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "动作小，自然更容易长期持续而不容易力竭。", "char_start": 772, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "而且因为本来问题少，也容易盯得住，摆得平，要积累到问题到无法全部照顾到，需要的时间要远比小男友们长。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 843}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这么长的稳定期，往往足以造成女方足够深的感情投入，走到“虽然不是完全满意，但是年纪也不小了，还是现实一点”的节点上，所以成功率会大得多。", "char_start": 844, "char_end": 912}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "这也是为什么现在首次结婚平均年龄是28.67岁（女27.95，男29.38）。", "char_start": 913, "char_end": 952}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "而初恋结婚的概率低于1%。", "char_start": 953, "char_end": 966}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "如果存在这种足以被二十出头、很容易被冒犯激怒的女孩子掌握，同时又对容易造成冒犯的同龄男孩子足够有效的优雅的“你在冒犯我”的表达，这个年龄会大幅提前提前，这个比例也不会低到接近于0了。", "char_start": 967, "char_end": 1058}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "简单来说——能优雅的表达被冒犯的前提，是对方对人的心思有足够的经验和敏感性，这对信息接收方的素质要求很高。", "char_start": 1059, "char_end": 1112}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "对这样的人，轻声说一句“这样我很为难”“我有点不太舒服”“这个风格我可能不太适应”往往已经足够了。", "char_start": 1113, "char_end": 1162}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "对于缺少经验而且对ta人情绪不太在意的人，客观上可能不存在优雅的表达方式，更适宜直接找理由无感脱离。", "char_start": 1163, "char_end": 1213}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "不必对此感到挫折和沮丧——能很好的判断出风险，没有激化矛盾而脱离，已经是胜利了。", "char_start": 1214, "char_end": 1254}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0607"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何优雅且有效地传达「你冒犯到我了」？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025"], "summary": "围绕“难得优雅”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“遗憾的是，这是个悖论——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "遗憾的是，这是个悖论——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 12, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2007f25c-11d5-598c-b390-49a4a4cb6dec", "source_ordinal": 4068, "reading_ordinal": 4279, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "乱我心者", "published_at": "2026-09-13T17:14:00.510000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/31404158/answer/2082517234208060113"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "你的大脑在为你和作者的关系而沮丧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "读文章、论文其实是与作者的一次对话。", "char_start": 18, "char_end": 36}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "作者试图通过一篇留言告诉你一些事情。但是你在这留言的字里行间读出了某种疏离感、某种冷淡。", "char_start": 37, "char_end": 81}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "这可能是作者采用了某种特定的叙述风格——例如只想说给已经熟知某些知识的读者听。", "char_start": 82, "char_end": 121}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "你觉得ta隐约有一种“如果你不知道这些，你就没资格获得这些知识”的不耐烦。", "char_start": 122, "char_end": 159}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "一种令你轻蔑的不屑。", "char_start": 160, "char_end": 170}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这隐隐的伤害了你的感情，让你也不愿意再就教于ta门下。", "char_start": 171, "char_end": 198}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "“知识是开放的，我可以去读其它更友善的前辈的教导，我不想给你再增加威名。”", "char_start": 199, "char_end": 236}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "这时继续寻求理解，已经有了自尊上的屈辱了，你的心里已经在尝试用“无法理解”来报复ta傲慢的晦涩。", "char_start": 237, "char_end": 285}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "如果作者不做那么多的前置知识的假设，从更根基处多铺垫一些引言，对你可能就会友善得多，但造化弄人——是ta没有时间精力也罢、是ta真的不屑与学力不足的人多费口舌也罢，总之现状就是如此了。", "char_start": 286, "char_end": 378}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "你确实可以换别人的论述来解决问题，但最好的选择还是引入一位诠释人，把你与作者的直接对话，转化为你与这位诠释者的讨论。", "char_start": 379, "char_end": 437}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这样你心里不自觉的沮丧和怨气可以消解很多，更能帮助你关注在具体内容上。", "char_start": 438, "char_end": 473}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "试一试吧。", "char_start": 474, "char_end": 479}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 14}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0607"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：「读完了文章的每个字，但不明白整段话的意思」，那我的大脑干了什么？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“乱我心者”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“你的大脑在为你和作者的关系而沮丧。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "你的大脑在为你和作者的关系而沮丧。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 17, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "2c7f5012-3cdb-526e-b972-e32b591abcbd", "source_ordinal": 4067, "reading_ordinal": 4280, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "同来客", "published_at": "2026-09-13T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2011878161814615909/answer/2082157732983993123"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "每到饭点，就有一整套化工厂开动起来：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "你的胃产生胃饥饿素（Ghrelin），通过血液和迷走神经影响大脑，推动进食冲动：", "char_start": 19, "char_end": 59}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "脂肪组织分泌瘦素（Leptin），告诉你的大脑储备能量充足，少吃点油的。", "char_start": 60, "char_end": 96}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你的胰腺在摄入营养物质后又开始释放胰岛（Insulin）。", "char_start": 97, "char_end": 126}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "参与你整个“该吃 - 吃得还不够 - 吃够了”流程的各路神仙还很多，族繁不及备载。", "char_start": 127, "char_end": 168}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "君闻歌而知雅意，应知这话去向何处。", "char_start": 169, "char_end": 186}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "如果你要把话说到“被激素控制”，谁的一生不是被激素控制的一生？", "char_start": 187, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "谁不是？", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 223}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只有性欲、情欲才控制人？只控制女人？", "char_start": 224, "char_end": 242}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "这话要“真”，不是不行，要说通当然可以，不需要凑什么奇葩案例，直接科学实验都可以证明个差不多。", "char_start": 243, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "问题是推开这扇门，会一拥而入的不止有你喜欢的客人。", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 316}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "何必呢？", "char_start": 317, "char_end": 321}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 12}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0607"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：有句话说「女性的一生是被激素控制的一生」，这句话是真的吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012"], "summary": "围绕“同来客”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“每到饭点，就有一整套化工厂开动起来：”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "每到饭点，就有一整套化工厂开动起来：", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 18, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "5d9a6ef2-0aa4-5f82-9de2-90615095459f", "source_ordinal": 4066, "reading_ordinal": 4281, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无差评", "published_at": "2026-09-13T19:21:08.325000+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/310719368/answer/2082546272330897214"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "因为一颗金子般的童心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我极其喜爱鸟山明，远远超过其它漫画作者。热爱他笔下的几乎所有的主人翁。", "char_start": 12, "char_end": 47}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是一群多么纯洁的孩子，心里从不沾染半点微尘。ta们虽然经常闯祸和胡闹，但几乎从来没有半点主动的恶意。", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "悟空即使在极端盛怒之下，有一切仇恨的理由，仍然不会放弃仁慈和和解。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 133}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "他一生中所有的敌人，绝大多数最后都变成了朋友——不少是可以舍生忘死、托妻献子的朋友。", "char_start": 134, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "与其说是是在一路战斗，不如说是治愈。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 195}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "他从不傲慢，从不虚荣，从不无礼、从不轻蔑和侮辱。", "char_start": 196, "char_end": 220}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "而且无论实力有多大的差距，他从不怯懦。", "char_start": 221, "char_end": 240}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "在所有人中，他是唯一获得无法阻挡的力量后不会令任何人恐惧的。", "char_start": 241, "char_end": 271}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "能如孩子般的生活，不必“长大”来向那些险恶而扭曲的世界妥协，是我们所有人的梦想。", "char_start": 272, "char_end": 312}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "谁不盼望有人真的可能做到。", "char_start": 313, "char_end": 326}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "为了这一点盼望，每个人都会举起双手，借出元气。", "char_start": 327, "char_end": 350}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这样的美好，如何“差评”？", "char_start": 351, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "《七龙珠》（截止到那美克星结束）是我永远推荐的儿童读物。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 393}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "如果只能看一部漫画，那就是它。", "char_start": 394, "char_end": 409}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 15}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0607"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么鸟山明的《龙珠》差评很少？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015"], "summary": "围绕“无差评”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“因为一颗金子般的童心。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "因为一颗金子般的童心。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 11, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
